title: Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: fundraising_timer <= 0 and ((not historical_mode) or violence_timer > 0)
on-arrival: fundraising_timer = 6; month_actions += 1
go-to: emergency if violence_timer > 0
frequency: 300
is-card: true
card-image: img/poster_2.jpg
tags: party_affairs

= Fundraising

For better or for worse, the party cannot exist without money.

- @maintain: Maintain our current dues.
- @reduce: Reduce dues.
- @increase: Increase dues.

@maintain
subtitle: [+ dues +] resources gained.
on-arrival: resources += dues;

We maintain our current dues.

@reduce
subtitle: [+ dues - 1 +] resources gained.
choose-if: dues > 1
on-arrival: dues -= 1; resources += dues; left_dissent -= 8; center_dissent -= 8; reformist_dissent -= 8; labor_dissent -= 8

Our current members appreciate this, but no one decides to join a party because of the low dues.

@increase
subtitle: [+ dues + 1 +] resources gained. [? if unemployed >= 15 : Given the present economic situation, this may be painful. ?][? if dues >= 4 : Dues are already rather high; increasing them might reduce our membership. ?]
on-arrival: dues += 1; resources += dues; workers_spd -= 3; unemployed_spd -= 3; workers_spd -= 10 if unemployed >= 15; unemployed_spd -= 10 if unemployed >= 15; workers_spd -= 3*dues if dues >= 5; unemployed_spd -= 3*dues if dues >= 5
view-if: dues <= 4

Our members grumble at this, and some of the less committed members leave. But now, we have access to additional resources. 

[? if unemployed >= 15 : Because of the presently high unemployment, our members are feeling the extra burden hard. ?]

@emergency

= Emergency Fundraising

[? if spd_bd_position == "support_kpd" : Cut off from government, we may need to rely more heavily on internal fundraising. ?]
[? if spd_bd_position != "support_kpd" : During times of crisis, perhaps it is necessary to increase our fees. ?]

- @emergency_regular: Collect regular contributions.
- @emergency_solidarity: Launch a solidarity appeal.
- @emergency_levy: Request an extraordinary levy.
- @emergency_unions: Seek trade-union support.
- @emergency_relief: Reduce the burden on distressed members.

@emergency_regular
subtitle: [+ dues +] resources gained.
on-arrival: resources += dues

We do not have a need for a a large amount of capital, for now...

@emergency_solidarity
subtitle: [+ dues + 1 +] resources gained; +1 more with an established welfare network.
choose-if: dissent < 0.3
unavailable-subtitle: Party divisions prevent a coordinated appeal.
on-arrival: resources += dues + 1; resources += 1 if workers_aid >= 2

The workers support us in droves! This is owed to our party cohesion[? if workers_aid >= 2 : and our established welfare network ?].

@emergency_levy
subtitle: [+ dues + 2 +] resources gained. Some in our party will be unhappy with this.
on-arrival: resources += dues + 2; left_dissent += 2; center_dissent += 2; reformist_dissent += 2; labor_dissent += 2

We put a massive emergency levy on our party memebers. This is not popular, but we gotta ( rewrite later ).
@emergency_unions
subtitle: [+ dues + 2 +] resources gained. +10 labor dissent.
view-if: not unions_independent
choose-if: labor_dissent < 40
unavailable-subtitle: The unions are unwilling to make an extraordinary contribution.
on-arrival: resources += dues + 2; labor_dissent += 10

The unions reluctantly agree to make large contributions to the party, but are understandably unhappy about it.

@emergency_relief
subtitle: [+ dues - 1 +] resources gained.
choose-if: dues > 1
unavailable-subtitle: Contributions cannot be reduced further while keeping the party funded.
on-arrival: resources += dues - 1; left_dissent -= 6; center_dissent -= 6; reformist_dissent -= 6; labor_dissent -= 6; neorevisionist_dissent -= 6

 We temporarily reduce the burden on our members, decreasing dissent.

